<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Siri Beta Check-In</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Video &middot; July 7 &middot; All tiers</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&#8217;ve been living with the Siri AI betas a bit longer than most of you, so I put together a batch of new tricks: chaining commands together, digging into personal context, and asking it things I used to have to type into Google.</p>



