<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Soulver 4 Update</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Video &middot; July 9 &middot; Pathfinder &amp; Insider</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Soulver, one of my favorite Mac utilities, got its first paid update in about seven years. I walk through what makes it click and the version 4 additions: tags, working with time and dates, taxes on a single line, and pulling in weather and stock prices.</p>



