<h3 class="wp-block-heading">The Lab Report for July 10, 2026</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Podcast &middot; July 10 &middot; All tiers</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The iOS 27 public beta lands this month, and this week&#8217;s developer betas gave us a real look at what&#8217;s coming. The Siri voice sliders finally work, the Golden Gate wallpaper is back on the Mac, and the rebuilt Siri showed up on the Apple Watch.</p>



